WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.877
A robust structured-output workflow expects failures.

00:00:03.877 --> 00:00:12.407
Generate the response, parse it, validate the schema, and use a small bounded retry when repair is appropriate.

00:00:12.407 --> 00:00:19.519
If validation still fails, stop predictably rather than passing malformed data deeper into the system.

00:00:19.969 --> 00:00:21.786
Retries should be bounded.

00:00:21.786 --> 00:00:29.001
If the model repeatedly violates the schema, returning a controlled error is safer than creating an endless generation

00:00:29.001 --> 00:00:30.145
loop.
